BEMC towers provide a precise energy measurement for isolated electromagnetic showers and the high spatial resolution provided by the SMD is essential for \(\pi^{0}\) reconstruction, direct photon and electron identification. Information on shower position, shape, signal amplitude and the electromagnetic shower longitudinal development, are provided by the BEMC.

